      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091420">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091422"> SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091424">Compare unsigned byte integers in mm2/m64 and mm1 and returns maximum values.</para>
